  "releaseNotes": "WJb.UI.Blazor 0.110.0\n\n            Monitor:\n            - Added date-based job browsing.\n            - Added server-side paging support.\n            - Added client-side search filtering.\n            - Improved performance when browsing large job collections.\n            - Added page navigation controls.\n\n            Features:\n            - Jobs monitoring and management.\n            - Job details and payload viewer.\n            - Actions browser.\n            - Services browser.\n            - Action execution and testing.\n            - Real-time job status updates.\n            - Responsive Blazor UI.\n\n            Quality:\n            - Simplified monitor query model.\n            - Updated monitor test coverage.",
